      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "If you change this property to false, the captured output contains only the windows on the screen (that is, the mouse pointer is invisible in captured video).",
      "normalizedSource": "If you change this property to false, the captured output contains only the windows on the screen (that is, the mouse pointer is invisible in captured video).",
